f needed. All credits are in the game.\n\nI do not own any licenses of any un-official/original soundtracks used in the game, nor any rights to anything else. This is just a passion project for fun\n\nOriginally made on February 10th 2023","path":"/game/17382280326-the-robloxia-until-dawn","slug":"17382280326-the-robloxia-until-dawn","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/7df606d5aabb9d4b6c22dbe35f8b89a51ca3542ef15fbc9041c7e332e11f81fb.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-04485429bc1df9254162cc3197c9e8e1/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":16,"visitor":21614728,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-02-24T02:28:06.161Z","creator":{"name":"The Robloxia: Until Dawn community","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":20,"freeCount":17,"keyCount":4,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":990566015,"name":"Cursed Islands","desc":"❤️ Use code \"350KLIKES\"! Exclusive code at 400K likes! ❤️\n🔥 Make sure to leave a like and invite your friends to play! 🔥\n\n🌴Welcome to Cursed Islands!🌴\nHop from island to island avoiding disasters. Level up, win coins, rubies, and more! Be the last one standing! \n\n🎒 Choose from 14 Gear Items to help you in-game!\n👕 Over 25 cosmetic items to purchase and equip!\n📻 Purchase dances and taunts to show off to your opponents!\n🏝️ Customise your own island!\n\n🎉 Make sure to hit the follow button for when new Updates drop! 🎉\n\nNEW UPDATE:\n- New Ghost Mode!\n- Bug Fixes!\n- x2 Coins Weekend!\n\n🎮 Brought to you by Voldex! 🎮\n\nTags: Survival, Islands, Party, Party Games, Multiplayer, Fun, Disaster","path":"/game/990566015-cursed-islands","slug":"990566015-cursed-islands","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/5678bcff6b8b9dc8a0056e2016dd8ea55e4120f9fe4943a653686b5d24a55701.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8f31619ce1484567f11297f047b96dbc/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":16,"visitor":477530676,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-14T05:51:32.097Z","creator":{"name":"Cursed Islands by Voldex","type":"Group"},"script":